window.products.push({"id":467047,"name":"STREET CRAFT Copper Tumbler Hammered Copper Glass Cup for Healing Ayurvedic Product Health Benefit Capacity 9 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zTeKpCUdL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"These copper tumblers or water glasses have healthful benefits. Storing water for three hours in copper tumbler is known certain diseases. According to the traditional hindu system of medicine known as ayurveda, drinking water from copper tumblers can get rid of skin inflammation and piles, as well as spleen, respiratory, and gynecological disorders. It is also known to prevent premature aging. Copper is slightly soluble in water, so water kept in this glass set . Beside this water kept in this set clears the waste attached with intestinal wall & keeps the stomach free from all stomach diseases, regulate cardiac orders, regulate many other order of body and makes a person cheerful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zTeKpCUdL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STREET CRAFT","source_asin":"B014W7KDX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014W7KDX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014W7KDX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
