window.products.push({"id":467061,"name":"Department 56 Dickens' Village Jolly Good Tune Accessory Figurine, 2.5 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lcScwT4iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country inn nestled in a quiet river town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lcScwT4iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AXTJ8CE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXTJ8CE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXTJ8CE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467062,"name":"Totally Bamboo Idaho State Shaped Bamboo Serving & Cutting Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oqhGd6dnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate life in The Gem State with the Totally Bamboo Idaho State Shaped Bamboo Serving and Cutting Board. This beautifully crafted board is in the shape of the great state of Idaho. The board is made of sustainably-sourced Moso bamboo, which is gentler on knives than plastic and easier to clean and care for than hardwood. It also works wonderfully as a serving platter for favorite meats, cheeses and all varieties of snacks— perfect for tailgating or entertaining at home! When it’s not being used in the kitchen or at get-togethers, the Idaho State Board also includes a hanging hole with a hang tie for an outstanding way to show your state pride on the wall of your home or office. It is built to last and easy to care for, simply hand wash and dry the board for the best results. Whether for yourself or the Idaho fan in your life, this board is sure to be hit!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oqhGd6dnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B00FDN78N6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FDN78N6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FDN78N6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467063,"name":"Dolce Mare Silicone Dough roll - Non-Stick Rolling pin - BPA Free Fondant roll for Pizza & All Other Pasta Products - The Dough roll Comes in a Noble ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eHjp8W0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you've ever baked a pizza at home, you probably know theproblem: the pizza just doesn't want to get as crispy as it does atyour favourite Italian restaurant. If the edge of the pizza is still okay, it gets more and more\"soggy\" towards the middle.... How can you make every homemade pizza from now on?Dolce Mare presents you with the perfect solution! The pizza stone from Dolce Mare - For crispy pizzas like at the Italian restaurant! Your advantages at a glance: - Crispy base with juicy topping - Perfectly suitable for grill & oven - Extremely durable & easy to clean - Free: Pizza pusher made of rubber wood - Quality from Dolce Mare Conjure up pizzas like from Bella Italia!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eHjp8W0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dolce Mare","source_asin":"B081D7HJ4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081D7HJ4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081D7HJ4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
