window.products.push({"id":467207,"name":"Biodegradable Bendable Straws Individually Wrapped - 330/Box 8.25\" Long Plant Based Corn Compostable Straws, Flexible Smoothie Straws Non BPA, Eco Fri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kZMhAKy9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Straw House: Some Things Weren't Meant To Last! We are a Canadian company providing you with high-quality, affordable, and sustainable products. We believe that the pleasure of bendable straws drinking experience shouldn’t come with the guilt of how it is impacting the environment. Whether you use the PLA plastic bendy straw for convenience, or protecting your teeth from strains, or just want to look cool, please do it guilt-free with our plant-based recycable straws. What is PLA? PLA stands for polylactic acid. It is a thermoplastic polyester that can be economically produced from renewable resources, such as corn starch, agave, hay, seaweed, hemp, birch, and so on. With the right time duration and temperature at a compost facility, PLA can be decomposed into the soil. Can you use it for hot beverages? Yes and no. Drinking very hot beverages at very high temperatures is not only unnecessary but also unsafe. We recommend a range of optimal temperature of between 130 F and 160 F (54 C and 71 C). Straw House 330-pack biodegradable straws are made from 100% corn starch and also 100% food safe. These straw alternatives were manufactured in accordance with ASTM D6400 Standard (Certified by International Biodegradable Products Institute #10528956-1) and OK Compost Criteria (Certified by TUA Austria #TA8011903477).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kZMhAKy9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Straw House","source_asin":"B08K1STQN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K1STQN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K1STQN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
