window.products.push({"id":467224,"name":"Get it on Sheets- Luxury Bed Sheet Set, King Size, 400 Thread Count. Long Staple Egyptian Cotton Soft and Comfortable. Easiest to Put On (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":174.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BOigjK+WL._AC_.jpg","description":"LUXURY BED SHEET SET with directional 18” deep pocket fitted bottom sheet, an over sized flat sheet, and 2 luxury pillowcases. These have impressive 400 thread count for super soft comfort. That's the maximum thread count for a single ply top quality sheet. These are breathable to keep you cool in summer and warm in winter. We only use 100% long staple Egyptian cotton woven in a deluxe sateen weave. Long staple are longest, natural cotton fibers famous for being very soft and silky smooth. You simply can't find nicer sheets. You will get a great night's sleep every time. PRODUCT FEATURES : Complete Luxury Sheet Set Complete Luxury Sheet Set Directional 18\" deep pocket fitted bottom sheet Directional 18\" deep pocket fitted bottom sheet Can fit perfectly on a 21\" mattress and stay fully on Can fit perfectly on a 21\" mattress and stay fully on Raised embroidered directional to get it on easier Raised embroidered directional to get it on easier Oversized flat sheet Oversized flat sheet 2 luxury pillowcases 2 luxury pillowcases 100% long staple Egyptian cotton 100% long staple Egyptian cotton Super soft, silky smooth, and breathable Super soft, silky smooth, and breathable Maximum 400 thread count Maximum 400 thread count 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE ensures this will be your best bet for a pleasing no-risk purchase. Many customers love the feel and quality of Get It On Sheets so much they return to buy another set. HURRY AND BUY NOW while we have a fresh shipment in stock. These make a much appreciated gift for friends, family, and co-workers - anyone who loves a great night's sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BOigjK+WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Get it on Sheets","source_asin":"B01N6RS2CO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6RS2CO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6RS2CO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467225,"name":"Footprints in The Sand Wall Art | Hanging Wood Plaque Engraved with Inspirational Poem | Positive Quotes Wall Decor for Home Living Room and Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TYsUQ2RIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed as a reminder that God is with you, this famous poem lends a thoughtful reminder that you are not alone in times of weakness.POSITIVE QUOTES WALL ARTMade to inspire, uplift, and encourage this wooden wall art is laser engraved with the Footprints In The Sand poem for daily motivation. Whether you display it in your bedroom, living room, or home office, this hanging wood sign will bring encouragement on a daily basis.MODERN FARMHOUSE WALL DÉCORIt is finished in a honey stain that highlights the natural woodgrain for a homey feel and makes a thoughtful gift for friends, family, and anyone you love. Perfect for graduation, weddings, and housewarming parties.READY TO HANG, AND DOUBLES AS TABLETOP DÉCORThis carved wooden wall art décor is pre-built with sawtooth hangers on the back for easy installation. This vertical sign makes for ideal contemporary white wall décor. Proudly display this 11.75 x 15-inch large wood plaque as living room wall décor or as an accent to your entryway wall for a daily reminder of your faith and devotion. Measuring at 0.75-inch thick, this sturdy engraved plaque can stand upright on tabletops for a lovely decorative accent. Showcase this wood sign in your office as cute desk décor or prop it up on your mantel shelf for a unique decoration that makes a statement.THE STORY BEHIND CAROL’S INSPIRATIONSCarol’s Inspirations is based out of Apple Creek, Ohio, and all wooden signs are proudly made in the USA. The inspirationinch behind the company is Carol, who successfully fought cancer for over 20 years. During that time, Carol found strength and hope from inspirational phrases printed on simple magnets. Carol’s Inspirations is now dedicated to bringing that same encouragement to those who may need it with thoughtfully engraved wooden plaques.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TYsUQ2RIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carol's Inspirations","source_asin":"B09ZYMF1L8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZYMF1L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZYMF1L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
