window.products.push({"id":467261,"name":"Apicizon Vanity Chair Stool, Velvet Round Storage Ottoman Footrest with Wood Tray Coffee Table & Golden Metal Leg, Dressing Footrest Stool for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PAqWqEK0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【ANTI-SLIP AND FOUR-METAL-LEGS DESIGN】 The stable base has 4 metal legs, making itself stronger than other ottomans. The non-slip rubber design at the bottom of the metal legs guarantees stablility, so the elder and children can sit at ease without tipping over. 【UPGRADED STORAGE DESIGN】When you lie on a sofa or recliner, not only can you rest your feet with the luxurious touch of the velvet, but also you can remove the cushion cover to store toys, books, magazines, etc. This upgraded family-friendly design allows more storage space to carry items, suitable for living room, bedroom, apartment, etc. 【TRAY COFFEE TABLE】 In addition to enjoying a comfortable foot pad, you can reverse the cushion cover to get a solid wooden tray, which is quite suitable for holding coffee, drinks, snacks, etc. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE FOR HOME DECOR】 It only takes three steps and 3 minutes to install this foot stool. When not in use, the legs can be easily removed and perfectly put into the storage space. This foot stool with wonderful silky feel will add elegance to your room. 【1-YEAR AFTER SERVICE】 If for any reason you're not completely happy with your purchase, please reach out and we will attempt to resolve any issues and ensure your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PAqWqEK0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Apicizon","source_asin":"B08FXT2ZZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXT2ZZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXT2ZZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467262,"name":"Modern Push Button Salt Grinder Pepper Grinder, Grind Gourmet Original Pump & Grind Cooking Gadgets, Spice Grinder, Pepper Mill, Salt N Pepper Grinder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31aCrzYIxxL._AC_.jpg","description":"FORM AND FUNCTION EXQUISITELY PAIRED Grind Gourmet is the creator of the Original Pump & Grind salt and pepper grinder set. Similar looking mills on the market are evidence of Grind Gourmet’s success however Grind Gourmet mills are made with a superior quality stainless steel, the core is solid steel not plastic so pressure from grinding will not cause the mill to break. Once you use these mills you’ll never want to be without them. Enjoy our environmentally friendly pepper grinders. FREE UP ONE HAND with Grind Gourmet’s Original Herb Grinder. Whether you are adding Himalayan sea salt or peppercorns to a dish/recipe these salt and pepper grinders easily do the job. Our one handed pepper mill and salt grinder will allow you to grind some fresh sea salt seasoning onto a hard-boiled egg or burrito while holding it with the free hand because thumb salt and pepper grinders do the work conventional two-hand operated salt and pepper mills require. NO MORE MESS No one likes the salt and pepper mess left over after seasoning a meal, we gotcha covered with our mess free stand. We designed our salt and pepper mill set to come with stands to hold your mills in place, keeping them from toppling over and contain residual grind granules from messing up the kitchen or tabletop. EASY TO USE EASY TO REFILL Operating our one handed pepper grinder is easy if my grandmother can use it so can you! Using our mills helps to keep your muscles in good shape. Put the battery powered grinder aside, keep your texting thumbs in good shape! To refill our mills we suggest keeping salt and pepper in freezer sized bags in your pantry to easily scoop pepper into the pepper grinder and salt into the salt mill. WE STAND BEHIND OUR PRODUCTS Every purchase is backed by a no-questions-asked policy we want you happy so in the unlikely event of a complication we’ll be around to assist you. We created the Original Pump & Grind in 2000 with the highest quality stainless steel to prevent rust and wear. You get what you pay for with Grind Gourmet products! We have offered the best salt and pepper grinders for almost two decades now there is a reason for that, we’ll be around should you need us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31aCrzYIxxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grind Gourmet","source_asin":"B00BTIAF0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BTIAF0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BTIAF0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
