window.products.push({"id":467295,"name":"Sleepnitez Side Sleep Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief 3 Layers of Soft Memory Foam for Adjustable Loft Queen Size White Washable Tencel Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IqcuLCImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you struggle with shoulder pain every morning after a night's sleep? Our Curved Edge Memory Foam Pillow is here to provide relief! This pillow is designed specifically to alleviate shoulder pain while you sleep, with its curved edge design promoting proper spinal alignment and reducing pressure on the shoulders. The three layers of memory foam work together to provide optimal support for the neck and shoulders, making it the perfect choice for anyone wanting pillows for neck pain, neck pillows for sleeping, or neck support pillows for sleeping. The first layer of memory foam conforms to the shape of your head and neck, providing cushioning and comfort, while the second layer provides extra support to keep your neck and spine in proper alignment. The final layer of firmer foam provides even more support, keeping your shoulders in a neutral position and reducing pressure on them throughout the night. Whether you're a side sleeper or suffer from chronic shoulder pain, our Curved Edge Memory Foam Pillow is the best shoulder pillow for you. Unlike other pillows that can become flat and lumpy over time, our pillow will maintain its shape and support, ensuring that you wake up feeling refreshed and pain-free. So, if you're looking for a pillow for side sleepers, a pillow for neck pain, or simply a pillow that can help you sleep more comfortably, our Curved Edge Memory Foam Pillow is the answer! Get yours today and start sleeping pain-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IqcuLCImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepnitez","source_asin":"B0BV26RVM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV26RVM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV26RVM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467296,"name":"Camden Isle Oxford Platform Bed Frame | Modern Low-Profile Bed with Full Slat Support System – No Box Spring Needed, Easy Assembly | White, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":302.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711z-waV5qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Platform Bed? A platform bed is a bed frame with a flat top that may not be slatted for integrated ventilation. Platform beds are unique because they can provide adequate support and are raised to an adequate level that requires no box spring. Moreover, wood slats are proximately packed and thus offer ultimate support. Hence, when you buy it, you make savings since you won’t need a box spring substructure. Air Ventilation and Support: A mattress’s life depends on the foundation’s surface, construction materials, and air circulation. A platform bed ascertains congruous air ventilation and avail to maximize your mattress’s life. Easy to Assemble: Platform beds can be easily broken apart and put together with simple instructions. The Easy-to-Install functionality is one of the most paramount advantages of a platform bed. Although they come disassembled, joining platform beds isn’t a problematic task. Our bed frames are packaged to pass through even narrow passages. Furthermore, all the tools you require to join the edges together form part of the package. Affordable Elegance: Since our platform beds don’t need box springs, they are more economical than a frame and box spring combination. You don’t need any other mattress foundation besides the platform bed. If you are on a tight budget and probing for the right kind of bed, then our platform beds just might make your day. Comfort Matters: People will spend one-third of their lives in bed on average. Therefore, choosing which type of bed to buy is very important. No matter how comfortable a mattress is, it will not support you rightly if placed on the wrong foundation. If sagging and indentations develop, you may be forced to repose in uncomfortable sleep positions, causing pressure and tension to build up in the muscles, leaving you sore and stiff in the morning. A platform bed is a good choice if you’re looking for: 1.\tA low-profile bed frame 2.\tA sturdy base 3.\tA bed that doesn’t need extra accessories like a box spring or mattress foundation A platform bed is more compatible than a box spring because it can accommodate most mattress types, including memory foam, latex, and hybrid mattresses. Box springs are most compatible with innerspring mattresses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711z-waV5qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camden Isle","source_asin":"B089D86WLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089D86WLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089D86WLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
