window.products.push({"id":467320,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Ashley Shelf Sturdy Steel Wire Storage Shelf & Cabinet Organizer, Expands to Fit Kitchen & Bathroom Cabinets, Rust-Resistant Fini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716ayeQTmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maximize cabinet and cupboard space with the Ashley Expandable Shelf from Spectrum Diversified. Two parts of the shelf slide to expand based on the size of your cabinet. There are no pegs locking the shelf into pre-selected sizes, so you can make it as large or small as desired. An extra set of legs in the middle of the shelf ensure the items are fully supported whether it is fully extended or not. Celebrate form, function, and style with one uniform look. The modern lines paired with classic finishes create a traditional appearance with a slight modern flair. Designed to coordinate with a variety of fixtures and furnishings around the home. The shelf slides easily into any cabinet, increasing the usable space. Utilize the vertical space by stacking glasses, mugs, plates, coffee and tea accessories, and more in the kitchen; stack cans and non-perishable goods in the pantry; layer medicines and vitamins in the bathroom; and organize knickknacks and jewelry in the bedroom. Store more with this versatile shelf. Additionally, the rust-resistant finish reduces the chance of corrosion. Use the storage and organization essential in the bathroom, near the sink, under the sink, or in the kitchen with confidence. Not recommended to place in the shower or bath. Perfect for increasing storage space in the kitchen, pantry, bathroom, office, and more. Steel is strong enough to support dishware, ceramic plates, china, coffee mugs, glassware, canned goods, coffee, tea, and more. Shelf features parallel wires to support a variety of items without strain. Reinforced steel legs support the weight of the shelf easily for secure storage. Made of sturdy steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716ayeQTmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B00E4BWJ4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E4BWJ4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E4BWJ4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
