window.products.push({"id":467654,"name":"FHSQX Clothes Storage Bins,Foldable Clothing Storage Box,Stackable Steel Frame Oxford Fabric Organizer with Clear Window & Carry Handles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vHiWd6FtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STACKABLE & FOLDABLE STORAGE BIN】: This storage box uses an integrated metal frame and reinforced MDF bottom plate, which is more durable than other disassembly storage boxes. When the storage box is opened, it can play a good supporting role to maintain a complete shape. When not in use, it can be folded flat to save space. Store on shelves, closets, garage, basement, attic, or under-bed/desk. 【OXFORD FRAME STORAGE BOX】: The clothes storage box is made of waterproof 600D Oxford cloth material and a sturdy stainless steel frame. Having a longer lifetime than those in non-woven fabric material reduces the frequency of your replacement storage products. and the built-in steel frame can keep the appearance neat and not easy to collapse. 【LARGE CAPACITY STORAGE BAG】: You will get two large storage bags. Big size 19.7 x 15.7 x 13 in and Medium Size 19.7 x 15.7 x 8 in, Small size 15.7 x 11.8 x 8. Can be used for blanket storage，clothes storage，toys, comforters, etc... 【CLEAR WINDOW and LABEL HOLDER】: Stackable storage bins have 2 clear PVC windows (Front and side) to view contents inside at glance without opening them, which helps you identify items quickly. And Label holder on the side can more effectively record the items in the storage box. 【EASY TO ACCESS and MOVE】: You can open from the top or the front, the top entry allowed you to fill them easily and the front entry allowed easy access to the items. The two-way zipper opens and closes smoothly and quickly every time. Both sides of the storage bag reinforced the handle for easy movement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vHiWd6FtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FHSQX","source_asin":"B09LV23VTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LV23VTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LV23VTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
