window.products.push({"id":467705,"name":"Microfiber Beach Towel Apex Legends Quick Dry Bath Towel Ultra Soft Lightweight Towel for Men Women Travel Camping Yoga Outdoor Compact Towels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811hzZISUcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We Are A Seller Specializing In Fashion And Exquisite Customization. We Have Many Different Styles, Fashion And Individual Themes.You Can Search For Leyuefeng Microfiber Beach Towel Directly On Amazon, And There Will Be Something You Like. This Interesting Quick-Drying Towel Is An Essential Holiday Product. It Is Made Of Microfiber And Has Better Water Absorption Than Standard Towels.You Can Give It As A Holiday Gift To Children, Parents, Friends, And Partners. Towels Can Be Used In Swimming, Yoga, Gym, Golf, Beach Vacation, Camping And Travel.Wash The Towel Before Using It For The First Time. You Only Need To Wash It By Hand Or Machine And Air Dry. Do Not Bleach. You Can Reuse It For A Long Time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811hzZISUcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEYUEFENG","source_asin":"B08X48QTNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X48QTNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X48QTNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467706,"name":"HOSPITOLOGY PRODUCTS Full Mattress Protector Hypoallergenic Natural Cotton - Waterproof - Fitted Cover - Machine Washable - 54\" W x 75\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WmDkIKcWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Mattress Protector by Hospitology is simply the best mattress Protector you can buy on Amazon.com. We use an All-Natural 100% Cotton Terry fabric as the sleep surface and bond it to a waterproof membrane, providing protection from spills & incontinence on top of your mattress. As you sleep, your body releases sweat, oil, and skin flakes. These substances get absorbed by your mattress, and help feed organisms that are often considered a major cause of sleep disruption and respiratory problems. The Protector reduces the chances of these body fluids from reaching your mattress, cutting off a vital food supply to the organisms that can disrupt sleep, None of this matters however, unless the Protector is comfortable to sleep on. Our Mattress Protector uses the THICKEST and most PLUSH cotton terry surface available on Amazon (5.3oz/yd2), yielding an ultra-soft, virtually noiseless product. The dual-stretch side panels wrap around your mattress like a fitted sheet, and can accommodate a mattress thickness of up to 18”. Also, unlike Vinyl, our waterproof membrane is Fully breathable, providing a cool and comfortable sleep surface. Please note: This Protector is meant to handle only small amounts of liquid that are addressed immediately. Larger amounts of liquid, and liquid that is allowed to sit for more than a few hours may eventually seep through Protector in the form of liquid vapor. Size: Full (54\"x75\") Machine washable, Tumble Dry Low or No Heat. Please follow all included care instructions to maintain your mattress Protector’s warranty. Contains no Vinyl, PVC, Phthalates, or Fire Retardant coatings of any kind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WmDkIKcWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOSPITOLOGY PRODUCTS","source_asin":"B09396DVWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09396DVWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09396DVWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
