window.products.push({"id":467716,"name":"BDI Furniture 9980 Revo Rotating Entertainment Cabinet, Single Wide, Espresso Stained Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jgohmZovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Revo is a perfect fit for smaller spaces. This single-wide rotating cabinet features adjustable shelves behind a curved, grey-tinted glass door. Open compartment near top can house a smaller center channel speaker, media or additional components. The entire system swivels on its base. Ships fully assembled except for easy back panel installation. For use with flat panel TVs up to 37\". From the Manufacturer The home theater has become a part of everyday home life. It’s where many hours are spent as family and friends come together for entertainment and relaxation. BDI Furniture merges innovative engineering and original design to seamlessly integrate today’s technology into the home. From the family room to the living room to the bedroom, there’s a BDI solution for any setting. The curved grey tinted glass door keeps components out of sight, yet is IR-friendly for remote control access The unique elliptical shape and integrated swivel make this model great for corners, small spaces and bedrooms Fits flat-panel TVs up to 37\" While beautiful, BDI furniture is more than meets the eye. Our home theater furniture is among the most thoroughly engineered furniture available today, designed to anticipate the needs of the most demanding home theater systems. Features such as adjustable shelves, cable management, speaker/media storage and hidden wheels provide simple setup, ease of use and lasting enjoyment.  These home theater cabinets ship almost completely assembled, requiring only minimal hardware installation by the user or installer. Packaging is environmentally conscious and thoroughly designed to ensure that everything arrives as expected. Sleek Design And Intelligent Features – It’s The Center Of Entertainment With a small footprint and integrated swivel, the Revo 9980 is a perfect choice for corners or small spaces. A column of components is concealed behind a curved grey tinted glass door with a fixed shelf above-–a perfect spot for a center channel speaker or a component. The component compartment features adjustable shelves that rest on threaded and cushioned shelf supports to minimize the transmission of vibrations. Flow-through ventilation slots are machined into the bottom panels, shelves and back panels to facilitate cooling airflow and protect components from overheating. Quick-release door hinges, removable back panels and integrated cable management make for a simple setup. The IR-friendly, grey tinted glass door allows for easy remote control access. Revo 9980 Internal Dimensions Recommended TV Size: up to 37” flat-panel TVs Recommended TV Size: up to 37” flat-panel TVs Arena TV Mount Compatibility: N/A Arena TV Mount Compatibility: N/A Component Capacity: 4 - 5 Component Capacity: 4 - 5 Number of Adjustable Shelves: 2 Number of Adjustable Shelves: 2 Adjustable Shelf Increments: 1.25 in / 32 mm; 9 positions Adjustable Shelf Increments: 1.25 in / 32 mm; 9 positions Top Shelf Capacity: 80 lbs / 36 kg Top Shelf Capacity: 80 lbs / 36 kg A. Top Open Compartment A. Top Open Compartment Interior Dimensions (H x W x D): 8 x 20 x 14.75-19.5 in / 20 x 51 x 37-49 cm Capacity: 75 lbs / 34 kg B. Component Compartment B. Component Compartment Interior Dimensions (H x W x D): 20.25 x 17.5 x 16.5 in / 51 x 44 x 31 cm Adjustable Shelf Capacity: 50 lbs / 23 kg Bottom Shelf Capacity: 100 lbs / 45 kg What’s in the Box Furniture, Instruction Sheet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jgohmZovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BDI Furniture","source_asin":"B07KCMMBLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCMMBLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCMMBLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
