window.products.push({"id":467742,"name":"2.5\" Clear Glass Votive Candle Holders for Candle Making Kit, Tealight Candles Holder Cup Set (72 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PWw5rr6jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A compact set of mini candle holders. Whether you're looking for wedding decorations or simple home decorations, these votive candle holders are the perfect tool to get you started. Simply provide the candle and set it inside one of these simple yet elegant cup holder. After, you have decorations all set with you votive candle holders, yankee candle accessories, and tealight candles! Thanks to the sturdy build of these candle holders, you can work with your candle making kit and candle making supplies to fill these candle holders with your favorite candles. Works with regular candles such as tealight candles, yankee candles, and votive candles. Also works with flameless tea lights, electric candles, and any small mini candle that can fit inside this mini glass cup candle holder set. This clear glass cup set is mini in size but perfect for candle making and adding to your bag of candle making supplies. Unlike mercury glass candle holders, these votive candle holder are clear glass which also make them perfect yankee candle accessories. Create a pleasant accent arrangement by grouping a few pillar candles together for any table setting. Add romance by placing white candles inside the glass candle holders around your hot tub or warm bubble bath. Also used to mix up different sizes for centerpieces that will add the perfect touch to your next dinner party. Each candle holder measures 2\" inches in diameter and 2.5\" inches in height. Fits a compact sized votive candle, yankee candle, tealight candles, and more! Comes in a package of 72 glass votive candle holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PWw5rr6jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Super Z Outlet","source_asin":"B01MY9MQTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MY9MQTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MY9MQTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
