window.products.push({"id":467959,"name":"Perched Pelican by Jai Johnson, 14x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611SgqF7a5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a Pelican sitting on a cut stump on the right side of the frame. Jai Johnson is a photographic artist living in West Tennessee who loves to spend her days in nature capturing life's most serene and peaceful moments, whether it be in landscapes, birds and wildlife, or the beauty of a simple flower. While her favorite subjects usually feature fur or feathers, rural country scenes and simple things also capture her photographic eye when she's behind the lens. When she's not out in nature capturing wildlife on camera, Jai spends her time in her studio transforming many of her original photographs into unique art by pairing them with hand-painted textures to create luxurious imagery filled with warmth, light, and color. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611SgqF7a5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B073ZNJFLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073ZNJFLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073ZNJFLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467960,"name":"Yoga Figure Figurine Ornament for Home, Zen Buddhist Namaste Yoga Statue Sculpture Indoor & Outdoor Decor for Birthday Mothers Day (Simple Sitting)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N-Ns1Lr3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧘Souls --Meditating with the most famous Yoga Pose, make your all stress and negative emotions be released, clear up distracting thoughts, and find the deepest self soul. Symbolizes love and peace, adding Zen and tranquility to your space ❣Chinese feng shui ornaments--this classic yoga ornament can bring good luck and auspiciousness, increase your wealth, and is one of the happiest feng shui items 🌟Zen Décor-- Enhance your home, office, garden, yard, meditation space, prayer room, sacred room, yoga studio, and an aquarium with this graceful Buddha statue, beautify your decoration place, will imparting a warm and comfort atmosphere to everywhere, bring positive impact in daily life 🌈High-Quality: Hand made by durable poly resin and stone powder construction, our yoga figurine is rust, weather and UV resistant to keep the statue looking new overtime. 💝Ideal Gifts – this yoga statue is 5.12x2.36x7.87 inches， is the perfect size as festivities, weddings, Fengshui gifts and others holidays present. Especially for the Buddhist family and friends lovers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N-Ns1Lr3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Echainstar","source_asin":"B097R5T5RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097R5T5RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097R5T5RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467961,"name":"Rachael Ray Solid Glaze Ceramics Dipping Cups / Ramekin Set for Snacks, Desserts, and More, Oval - 4 Piece, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIQTEWZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Serve sauces and dips in style with the Rachael Ray Ceramics 4-Piece Oval Dipping Cups Set. These cheerful 3-ounce serving cups are perfect for a variety of yummy condiments and dips, from Rachael’s Chipotle Ketchup to go with her Tex-Mex Bacon Cheeseburgers to her Tartar Sauce for dipping fish sticks. The cups are especially ideal for keeping foods and flavors separated, or set out with salts, red pepper chili flakes, and other dry seasonings at a casual Italian dinner. Featuring durable ceramic construction and the perfect size for dipping convenience, these handy serving cups are a great addition to any meal. The dipping cups have flared handles to make them easy to hold and are dishwasher, microwave, freezer safe and oven safe to 500°F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIQTEWZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B07TKFG7TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TKFG7TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TKFG7TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467962,"name":"Warm Feather Dream Catchers, Blue Dream Catcher Large Wall Hanging Home Decor Bedroom for Boys&Girls&Kids. Handmade from Feathers and Wooden Beads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716fJPsuzrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: Dream Catcher Legend: Beautiful Story Dream catchers originated in the 18th century. They use it to capture beautiful dreams and let nightmares disappear with the morning sun. They believe that the night air is full of various dreams and only dream catchers can filter dream and bring them into beautiful dreams. Dreamcatcher manufacture: Traditional Handmade Dream catcher The traditional dream catchers is made by weaving branches into a circle wrapping it with leather around the circle and then using beef tendon thread to make a net around the circle. Occasionally colored beads are worn on the tendon line and some feathers are hung from leather on one end of the circle. There is a round hole in the middle of the net. Legend has it that only good dreams can pass through that hole and flow down along the feathers while nightmares will be trapped in the net and disappear without a trace in the sun the next day... Dreamcatcher specifications: size: 6.3Inch / 16cm Diameter 23.6Inch / 60cm Long. weight: 2.26ounces. Why choose our dream catcher ? Dream catchers material contains: Metal ring&Korean suede leather rope&disinfected and fumigated blue feathers&high-strength braided wire and wooden beads made of a soft and environmental material. We still follow the traditional handmade dream catchers.Beautiful dream catcher wall hanging decor for boys&girl&kids bedroom/Livingroom&balcony and wedding. Reminder: Since each dream catcher is made different craftsman, the product may be little different, but don't worry, can decorate well where you need it，can better reflect dreamcatcher uniqueness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716fJPsuzrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warm Feather","source_asin":"B09B6TRYXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B6TRYXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B6TRYXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
