window.products.push({"id":467990,"name":"10 Pack Baby's Breath Artificial Flowers Bulk 3 Branches Faux Baby Breath Plastic Flowers Fake Gypsophila Flower Arrangement for Crafts Fake Flowers B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nk6QWEcYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Material: Our baby breath flowers artificial bulk are made of environmentally friendly, non-toxic and tasteless plastic,this material is waterproof and uv resistant! Never deform and fade.So you can use babies breath flowers artificial indoor and outdoor.Each flower head is manually attached, If the flower head falls during transportation, simply attachment back to the stem.This is not a product quality issue The Gypsophila Flower will not deform even if it is squeezed.Babys breath bulk are suitable for most vases.Those adorable white gypsophila flowers are absolute best so as to add colour to any arrangement.Beautiful baby's breath wildflower bush. Use this full baby's breath bush for an adorable centerpiece, or clip apart and use as filler flowers in your vintage weddings or rustic weddings bouquets for an accent of pretty white flowers to match any design! Easy to DIY - Each babys breath flower head can be removed and inserted.Bendable wired plastic stem - You can shape and cut the length you want.Faux baby's breath gypsophila flowers don't need maintenance or watering Nice decorations for wedding bouquets, party, home lounge, dining table, bed room, toilet, operating place of job, gallery, public puts and holiday decoration.Creating a romantic atmosphere for the wedding, house and party.Making a bouquet with fake babies breath is a perfect romantic gift for your friends. Fake Gypsophila Size - Full height: 23.6 inches; Total 10 stems Faux gypsophila flower, toatl about 1075 little flowers.TIPS:The babies breath flowers are bended packaged carefully, to unbox the artificial plant, take each stem one at a time and pull the plastic bag downward (not upward) to make sure the flowers do not fall. If they do, simply attach them back to the stem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nk6QWEcYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DILATATA","source_asin":"B097P2QVXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097P2QVXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097P2QVXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":467991,"name":"Command Small Hooks, Clear, 2-Hook, 6-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zwov486+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Scotch Delicate Surface Painter’s Tape is great for surfaces that require a little extra care such as wood floors, wallpaper, cabinets, painted drywall, and freshly painted walls* (*painted at least 24 hours ago). This delicate surface tape with gentle adhesive can stay on surfaces for up to 60 days and then removes easily without leaving any sticky residue behind. This tape features Edge-Lock Technology that seals out paint to deliver sharp paint lines and clean removal for your more sensitive projects, including accent walls, decorative stripes and patterns. Whether you're protecting your hardwood floors from paint splatter or going all out with a decorative mural, rely on Scotch Delicate Surface Painter's Tape for a professional look that's easy on your surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zwov486+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Command","source_asin":"B00UX9WKSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-467991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UX9WKSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UX9WKSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
